{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot Loop is a relaxing incremental dungeon crawler. Dive into short runs that last just seconds, and come back stronger with every upgrade. Each attempt feels rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/cc0e14f322a840ced3aa9dee666d1297.webp?t=1764594409\" width=1170 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/b31f89b707086492d4e5e69b49363cd5.poster.avif?t=1764594409\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/b31f89b707086492d4e5e69b49363cd5.webm?t=1764594409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather loot, unlock new skills in your tree, and watch tiny adventurers grow into mighty heroes. Progress is always visible, and every run takes you a step forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/233a28f46bd5af98c71ed67a45dfa3f1.webp?t=1764594409\" width=1170 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/e4e9cb7a934c207260f6baf055eda09f.poster.avif?t=1764594409\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/e4e9cb7a934c207260f6baf055eda09f.webm?t=1764594409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore pixel dungeons inspired by the classics of the 80s. Small characters, dark corridors, and charming details create a cozy, nostalgic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/27f88bf9eec68bc1b1a8b8006cf0300c.webp?t=1764594409\" width=1170 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/2ca169b140dd9ef8eb3bddaebcf849e6.poster.avif?t=1764594409\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/2ca169b140dd9ef8eb3bddaebcf849e6.webm?t=1764594409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no pressure here. Short runs, simple controls, and a chill rhythm let you enjoy the adventure at your own pace.<br><br>Are you ready for adventure?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972320?t=1764594409","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972320?t=1764594409","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/2b4af6a7ee31e0ff34e4af4dbbf98ac5cdc14830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764594409","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/2b4af6a7ee31e0ff34e4af4dbbf98ac5cdc14830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764594409","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime"